1. ap-lu!-ut be-le-su-nu _lukur_ {d}utu _dumu-munus_ ma-ni-um
#tr.ts: aplūt bēle(s)sunu nadīt šamaš mārat manium
#tr.en: Inheritance of Bēlessunu, nadītu of Šamaš, daughter of Manûm;

2. {disz}geme2-{d}ma-mu _lukur_ {d}utu _dumu-munus_ sin-dingir
#tr.ts: amat-māmu nadīt šamaš mārat sîn-ilī
#tr.en: Amat-māmu, nadītu of Šamaš daughter of Sîn-ilī

3. re-di-it wa-ar-ka-ti-sza _5(iku) GAN2 a-sza3 a-gar3_ puzur4-il3-a-ba4
#tr.ts: rēdīt warkatīša ḫamšat ikû eqlum ugārum puzur-ilaba
#tr.en: is the inheritor of her legacy. A field of 5 IKU in the Puzur-ilaba irrigation district

4. i-ta _a-sza3_ {d}suen-na-s,ir _dumu_ sin-ma-gir u3 _a-sza3 a-gar3_ du-um-mu-qa2
#tr.ts: itā eqel sîn-nāṣir mār sîn-māgir u ugār dummuqa
#tr.en: next to the field of Sîn-nāṣir son of Sîn-māgir and the meadow of Dummuqa

5. _dumu-munus_ nu-ur2-i3-li2-szu u3 i-ta _a-sza3_ szu-i3-li2-szu _dumu_ u2-s,i2-ia-tum
#tr.ts: mārat nūr-ilīšu u itā eqel šū-ilīšu mār uṣiyatum
#tr.en: daughter of Nūr-ilīšu and next to the field of Šū-ilīšu son of Uṣiyatum,

6. _sag-bi 1(disz)-kam-ma_ a-tap _a-gar3 sag-bi 2(disz)-kam sag-du3_
#tr.ts: pūssu maḫrītum atap ugārim šanītum pūssu santakkum
#tr.en: its first front (side) is the ditch of the irrigation district, its second front (side) is the triangular field;

7. _1(bur3) 2(iku) GAN2 a-sza3 a-gar3_ puzur4-il3-a-ba4 i-ta nu-ur2-i3-li2-szu sza _siki-hi-a_
#tr.ts: ištēn būr šinā ikû eqlum ugārum puzur-ilaba itā nūr-ilīšu ša šīpātim
#tr.en: a field of 20 IKU in the Puzur-ilaba irrigation district next to (the field of) Nūr-ilīšu of the fleece (?)

8. u3 i-ta _a-sza3_ be-le-su-nu _lukur_ {d}utu _dumu-munus_
#tr.ts: u itā eqel bēle(s)sunu nadīt šamaš mārat
#tr.en: and next to the field of Bēlessunu nadītu of Šamaš daughter of ,

9. _sag-bi 1(disz)_-kam-ma_ a-tap _a-gar3 sag-bi 2(disz)-kam a-sza3_ ur-{d}lugal-banda3{da}
#tr.ts: pūssu maḫrītum atap ugārim šanītum pūssu eqel ur-lugalbanda
#tr.en: its first front is the ditch of the irrigation district, its second front is the field of Ur-lugalbanda;

10. _1(esze3) 3(iku) GAN2 a-sza3 a-gar3_ ak-ba-rum i-ta _a-sza3_ mu-na-wi-rum _dumu_ lu2-dingir
#tr.ts: ištēn ebel šalāšat ikû eqlum ugārum akbarum itā eqel muna(w)wirum mār awīl-ilī
#tr.en: a field of 9 IKU in the Akbarum irrigation district next to the field of Munawwirum son of Awīl-ilī

11. u3 i-ta _a-sza3 lukur_ {d}utu sza i-ta _a-sza3_ {d}suen-eri-ba _dumu_ dumu-zimbir{ki}
#tr.ts: u itā eqel nadīt šamaš ša itā eqel sîn-erība(m) mār mār-sippir
#tr.en: and next to the field of the Šamaš’s nadītu that is next to the field of Sîn-erībam son of Mār-sippar,

12. _sag-bi 1(disz)-kam-ma_ {i7}nu-ra-tum _sag-bi 2(disz)-kam-ma e_ sa-mu-um
#tr.ts: pūssu maḫrītum nūratum šanītum pūssu īki samum
