13. _2(esze3) GAN2 a-sza3 a-gar3_ pa-hu-s,um{ki}
#tr.ts: šinā ebel eqlum ugārum paḫuṣum
#tr.en: a field of 12 IKU in the Paḫuṣum irrigation district

