16. ($ blank space $) _szunigin 2(bur3) 1(esze3) 4(iku) GAN2 a-sza3 a-gar3_-ri-sza-am
#tr.ts: napḫarum šinā būr ištēn ebel erbet ikû eqlum ugārišam
#tr.en: the total is 46 IKU of field(s), listed by district;

17. _1(disz) 1/3(disz) sar e2 du3-a u3 ki-gal2_ i-na _ga2-gi-a{ki}_
#tr.ts: ištēn šaluš mūšar bītum epšum u maškanum ina gagîm
#tr.en: a built house and an unbuilt plot of 80 shekels in the cloister

18. _da e2_ geme2-kal-la-tim u3 _da e2 dumu-munus_ da-qum
#tr.ts: ṭēḫi bīt amat-kallatim u ṭēḫi bīt mārat da(q)qum
#tr.en: adjacent to the house of Amat-kallatum and adjacent to the house of Daqqum’s daughter;

19. _6(disz) sar e2 ki-gal2_ i-na zimbir{ki}-gal i-na _sila {d}imin-bi_
#tr.ts: šeššet mūšar maškanum ina sippir-rabûm ina sūqu sebettum
#tr.en: an unbuilt plot of 6 SAR in the "Great Sippar", in the street "The Seven (gods)";

20. _1(disz) sag-nita2_ {d}suen-ma-asz-ma-asz u3 _szesz-ni_
#tr.ts: ištēn wardum sîn-mašmaš u aḫūšu
#tr.en: a male slave (named) Sîn-mašmaš and his brother;

21. _1(disz) sag-nita2_ a-na-pa-ni-{d}utu-na-di x _aszgab_
#tr.ts: ištēn wardum ana-pānī-šamaš-nadi ... aškāpum
#tr.en: a male slave (named) Ana-pānī-šamaš-nadi ... leatherworker;

22. _2(disz) {uruda}szen-hi-a_ mi-im-ma an-nu-um bu-szu-sza wa-ar-ka-sa3
#tr.ts: šinā ruqqū mimma annûm būšūša warka(s)sa
#tr.en: 2 copper cauldrons; all this, her properties (and) her inherited possessions,

23. s,u2-lu-sza sza i-na i-ga-ri-im za-aq-pa-at
#tr.ts: ṣu(l)lûša ša ina igārim zaqpat
#tr.en: her pin is stuck into the wall,

24. isz-tu pe2-e a-di _ku3-sig17_ sza be-le-su2-nu _dumu-munus_ ma-ni-um
#tr.ts: ištu pê adi ḫurāṣim ša bēle(s)sunu mārat manium
#tr.en: everything (lit. from chaff to gold) that Bēlessunu daughter of Manûm

25. ir-szu-u2 u3 i-ra-asz-szu-u2 sza geme2-{d}ma-mu-ma a-pil-ti-sza
#tr.ts: iršû u iraššû ša amat-māmūma apiltīša
#tr.en: owns or will acquire, belongs to (lit. is of) Amat-māmu her heiress,

26. _dumu-munus_ sin-dingir a-di be-le-su2-nu _lukur_ {d}utu ba-al-t,a3!-at!
#tr.ts: mārat sîn-ilī adi bēle(s)sunu nadīt šamaš balṭat
#tr.en: daughter of Sîn-ilī. As long as Bēlessunu the nadītu of Šamaš lives,

27. mi-im-ma-sza qa2-ti geme2-{d}ma-mu u2-ka-al-ma
#tr.ts: mimmâša qāti amat-māmu ukālma
#tr.en: (lit. the hand of) Amat-māmu will hold her (Bēlessunu’s) property and

28. i-na _mu 1(disz)-kam 6(asz) sze gur 1(u) 2(disz) ma-na siki-ba_
#tr.ts: ina ištēt šattim šeššet kur še’am šinšeret manā lubūšam
#tr.en: every year: 1.800 litres of barley, 12 minas of clothing allowance,

29. _2(ban2) 4(disz) sila3 i3-ba 6(disz) ezem-hi-a 2(ban2) zi3-da-hi-a_
#tr.ts: šitta šât ešret qa piššatam šeššet isinnī šitta šât qēmam
#tr.en: 24 litres of oil allotment, 6 "isinnu" food portions, 20 litres of flour,

30. _2(disz) uzu-ta-a_ {disz}geme2-{d}ma-mu _lukur_ {d}utu dumu-munus_ sin-dingir i-pa-aq-qi2-si
#tr.ts: šinā šīrī amat-māmu nadīt šamaš mārat sîn-ilī ipaqqi(s)si
#tr.en: 2 thigh-cuts of meat, Amat-māmu nadītu of Šamaš daughter of Sîn-ilī will provide her.

31. _2/3(disz) ma-na 6(disz) gin2 ku3-babbar_ hu-bu-li {disz}be-le-su2-nu
#tr.ts: šinip manā šeššet šiqil kaspam ḫubu(l)li bēle(s)sunu
#tr.en: 46 shekels of silver, a debt of Bēlessunu,

32. {disz}geme2-{d}ma-mu _dumu-munus_ sin-dingir i-pu-ul
#tr.ts: amat-māmu mārat sîn-ilī īpul
#tr.en: Amat-māmu daughter of Sîn-ilī paid (so)

33. {disz}be-le-su2-nu u2-ul ih-ta-ba-al
#tr.ts: bēle(s)sunu ul iḫtabal
#tr.en: Bēlessunu is no (more) in debt.

34. mi-im-mu-sza an-nu-um a-na hu-bu-li-sza u2-ul iz-za-az
#tr.ts: mimmûša annûm ana ḫubu(l)līša ul izzaz
#tr.en: All her (aforementioned) property will not be liable for her debt (and)

35. sza sze-a-am u3 _ku3-babbar_ i-qi2-pu-szi i-na mi-im-mu-sza i-te-el-li
#tr.ts: ša še’am ū kaspam iqi(p)pūši ina mimmûša ītelli
#tr.en: whoever would lend barley or silver to her, would have no right to (lit. will forfeit) her property.

36. isz-tu be-le-su2-nu ap-lu-sa3 an-ni-tam a-na geme2-{d}ma-mu
#tr.ts: ištu bēle(s)sunu aplū(s)sa annîtam ana amat-māmu
#tr.en: After Bēlessunu this inheritance (lit. of her) to Amat-māmu

37. _dumu-munus_ sin-dingir id-di-nu-ma _mu 2(disz)-kam_ i-pe2-ru-szi
#tr.ts: mārat sîn-ilī iddinūma šittā šanātim īpirūši
#tr.en: daughter of Sîn-ilī gave and supported her for two years,

38. {disz}geme2-{d}utu _dumu-munus_ i3-li2-i-qi2-sza {disz}ni-szi-i-ni-szu _dumu-munus_ dingir-pi2-{d}utu
