39. _dumu-munus-mesz_ a-ah-hi a-bi-sza a-na _a-sza3_-am sza pi2-i t,up-pi2
#expected _a-sza3_-im
#tr.ts: mārāt aḫḫī abīša ana eqlim ša pî ṭuppi(m)
#tr.en: her (of Bēlessunu) cousins (lit. the daughters of her father’s brothers), for the field(s) which are reported in this tablet,

40. an-ni-im ir-gu-ma-ma# t,up-pa-at nu-du-ni {disz}be-le-su2-nu
#tr.ts: annîm irgumāma ṭuppāt nudu(n)nî bēle(s)sunu
#tr.en: raised a claim. The tablets concerning (lit. of) the dowry of Bēlessunu,

