#tr.en: before Rīš-šamaš son Luštamar-sîn;

41. _igi_ pa-le-e-{d}utu _dumu_ {d}utu-na-ap-sze-ra-am
#tr.ts: maḫar palê-šamaš mār šamaš-napšeram
#tr.en: before Palê-šamaš son of Šamaš-napšeram;

42. _igi_ sig-an-nu-ni-tum
#tr.ts: maḫar ipqu-annunitum
#tr.en: before Ipqu-annunitum;

43. _igi_ i-bi-{d}nin-szubur _dumu_ nu-ur2-i3-li2-szu
#tr.ts: maḫar i(b)bi-ilabrat mār nūr-ilīšu
#tr.en: before Ibbi-ilabrat son of Nūr-ilīšu;

44. _igi_ {d}iszkur-ma-an-szum2 _dumu_ ARAD-i3-li2-szu _i3-du8 ka2 ga-gi-a_
#tr.ts: maḫar adad-manšum mār warad-ilīšu ati gagîm
#tr.en: before Adad-manšum son of Warad-ilīšu, the doorkeeper of the cloister;

45. _igi_ geme2-{d}utu _dumu-munus sin-i3-qi2-sza _igi_ ni-szi-i-ni-szu _dumu-munus_ dingir-pi2-sza
