#tr.ts: ina qabê sîn-ismeanni u kār sippir
#tr.en: By order of Sîn-išmeanni and the kāru body of Sippar,

19. [t,up]-pa-szu an-ni-a-am a-na pi2-i szi-[bu-tim u2-ba-al-li-t,u2-ma]
#tr.ts: ṭuppašu annîam ana pî šībūtim uballiṭūma
#tr.en: they have let this relevant tablet drawn up according to the testimony of the witnesses so (if)
