3. [a-na] inim#-{[d]}a-a a-ha-at a-bi-sza um-mi-sza
#tr.ts: ana awāt-ayya aḫat abīša ummīša
#tr.en: to Awāt-ayya her aunt, her (adoptive) mother,

4. [u2-ul um-mi at-ti i]-qa2-ab-bi-i-ma
#tr.ts: ul ummīya atti iqabbīma
#tr.en: says: "You are not my mother!",

5. [i-na ... i]-te-el-li u3 inim-{d}a-a
