#tr.ts: ana bele(s)sunu ul mārtī atti iqabbīma
#tr.en: to Bēlessunu says: "you are not my daughter!",

7. [...] x a-di in-bi-ki _lukur#_ {d#}utu
#tr.ts: ... adi inbi-erṣetim nadīt šamaš
#tr.en: ... as long as Inbi-erṣetim nadītu of Šamaš

8. [ba-al-t,a-at _mu 1(disz)-kam n] gin2# ku3-babbar 6(disz) sila3 i3-gesz_
#tr.ts: balṭat ištēn šattim ... kaspam šeššet qa šamnam
#tr.en: is alive, every year ... silver, 6 litres of oil

9. [{disz}be-le-su2-nu _dumu-munus_] pa-la-{d}iszkur
#tr.ts: bēle(s)sunu mārat palā-adad
#tr.en: Bēlessunu daughter of Palā-adad

10. [i-na-ad]-di-isz-szi-im
#tr.ts: inaddiššim
#tr.en: will give her.

11. [_mu_ {d}utu {d}a-a] {d}marduk
#tr.ts: nīš šamaš ayya marduk
#tr.en: (By) the life of Šamaš, Ayya, Marduk

12. [u3 sa-am-su-i-lu-na] _lugal# in-pa3-de3-mesz_
#tr.ts: u samsu-iluna šarrim itmû
#tr.en: and Samsu-iluna the king, they have sworn.

13. [_igi_ ARAD-{d}suen] _sanga_ {d}utu
#tr.ts: maḫar warad-sîn šangêm šamaš
#tr.en: Before Warad-sîn, chief admninistrator of Šamaš(' temple);

14. [_igi_ sin-e-ri-ba-am] _sanga_ {d}utu
#tr.ts: maḫar sîn-erībam šangêm šamaš
#tr.en: before Sîn-erībam, chief admninistrator of Šamaš(' temple);

15. [_igi_ a-wi-il]-isz8-tar2 _dumu_ {d}nanna-tum
#tr.ts: maḫar awīl-ištar mār nannatum
#tr.en: before Awīl-ištar son of Nannatum;

16. [_igi_ sig-an-nu-ni]-tum! _dumu_ dingir-szu-ba-ni
#tr.ts: maḫar ipqu-annunītum mār ilšu-bānī
#tr.en: before Ipqu-annunītum son of Ilšu-bānī;

17. [_igi_ {d}marduk-ni]-szu _ugula lukur {d}utu-mesz_
#tr.ts: maḫar marduk-nīšu akil nadiāt šamaš
#tr.en: before Marduk-nīšu, overseer of Šamaš's nadītus;

18. [_igi_ ra-pa-asz]-s,il2-li2-e2-a _ugula lukur {d}utu-mesz_
