#tr.en: before Rapaš-ṣilli-ea, overseer of Šamaš's nadītus;

19. [_igi_ a-wi]-il#-{d}iszkur _dub-sar lukur {d}utu-mesz_
#tr.ts: maḫar awīl-adad ṭupšar nadiāt šamaš
#tr.en: before Awīl-adad, scribe of the Šamaš's nadītus;

20. [_igi_ lu-sza]-lim-be-li2 tap-pu-szu
#tr.ts: maḫar lū-šalim-bēlī tappûšu
#tr.en: before Lū-šalim-bēlī, his colleague.

21. [_igi_ ...]-ba-ni _igi_ i-bi-{d}nin-szubur
#tr.ts: maḫar ...-bānī maḫar i(b)bi-ilabrat
#tr.en: Before ...; before Ibbi-ilabrat,

