#tr.ts: šinā manā libbu šīm būrim ša šālaš šanātim
#tr.en: 2 minas (of silver), part of the price of the three-years-old calf

7. sza i-na _e2-gal_ a-na _dam-gar3-mesz_ in-na-ad-nu 
#tr.ts: ša ina ekallim ana tamkārī innadnū
#tr.en: that has been given to the merchants at the palace (and that)

8. it-ti _dam-gar3-mesz sipa-mesz_ i-sza-mu 
#tr.ts: itti tamkārī rē’ū išāmū
#tr.en: the shepherds purchased from the merchants,

9. _ku3-babbar_ i-na qa2-ti _sipa_ it-ta-ad-di-nu-ma 
#tr.ts: kaspam ina qāti rē’îm ittaddinūma
#tr.en: (the merchants) every time have handed over the silver (received) from shepherds’ hands and

10. a-na _nig2-ka9_ isz-ta!-ak#-ka#-nu# 
#tr.ts: ana nikkassim ištakkanū
#tr.en: have deposited into the account;

$ single ruling 
