#tr.en: of the year 31 of Ammi-ditana (lit. the year: "For Ninurta the foremost wild bull, his helper")

11. a-di _iti szu-numun-a mu alan_ sa-am-su-[i-lu-na] _pa4-bil-ga-ni_ 
#tr.ts: adi waraḫ dumuzi šanat ṣalam samsu-iluna abi abīšu
