#tr.ts: waraḫ kišlīmim ūmam šalāšat
#tr.en: The month of Kišlīmum, the day 3,

7. _mu_ am-mi-di-ta-na _lugal-e alan nam-nun-na-ni_ 
#tr.ts: šattum ša ammi-ditana šarrum ṣalam rubûtim
#tr.en: the year in which Ammi-ditana the king (brought into Esagila) a statue of his rulership.

